# TypeScript composite-build artifacts. Previously these were emitted next
# to vite.config.ts, which caused vite to prefer the stale compiled .js
# over the source .ts. tsconfig.node.json now emits into node_modules/,
# but keep these here so a fresh clone from an older commit stays clean.
